        "id": 236942,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-17T18:08:45.026Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The major difference that I can see is that Speed lets you do <em>anything</em> quickly (e.g. eating, typing, punching). Momentum only lets you move quickly, but it <em>also</em> lets you “channel” that movement for powerful impacts. (Interpret that as you will.)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-04-17T18:08:45.026Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
